			"notes": "+ Added Best Friend mechanics\n    + If you have enough affinity (750 at the moment), you can set yourself as their best friend by using a stick on them.\n    + You can shift+right click with a stick to remove your best friend status.\n    + You cannot be best friends with a Human who already has a best friend.\n    + You can right click with a poppy to see what your affinity with them is.\n    ~ Humans will now follow the player who is their best friend instead of the closest player with high affinity.\n+ You can right click with a liked item to give it to Humans now."
